===== [ch1] build_makers
db.products.aggregate([
  { $sort: { model: 1 } },
  { $group: { _id: "$maker", products: { $push: { model: "$model", type: "$type" } } } },
  { $sort: { _id: 1 } },
  { $out: "makers" }
])
----->


